      "title": {
        "en": "Drugie danie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A Polish *drugie danie* is often *mięso* (meat), a *kotlet* or *ryba* (fish), with *ziemniaki*, *kasza* (buckwheat or barley groats) or *ryż*, and a *surówka*, a salad of raw grated vegetables. *Tłusty* is fatty and *chudy* lean: *chudy ser*, *tłusta kiełbasa*."
      }
    }
  ],
